Z||000007||theogre||09-15-2000||08:57 PM||||Acording to my schematics and notes the ECM fuse will not clear codes. It will disable the ECM but exactly what it does I can't tell. The Orange wire I mentioned above is direct from the battery with a fuse link in it.||||reg||1
Z||000008||ka4nkf||09-15-2000||10:30 PM||||The 84 disconnect is under the intake manifold by the oil filter.||||reg||1
